      "id": "main-thread-call-365b55",
      "name": "MainThreadCall",
      "category": "CocoaThread",
      "signature": "MainThreadCall(Block, Wait, Wait Mode)",
      "params": [
        {
          "name": "Block",
          "type": "dispatch_block_t"
        },
        {
          "name": "Wait",
          "type": "Bool",
          "default": "true"
        },
        {
          "name": "Wait Mode",
          "type": "NSString*",
          "default": "NSDefaultRunLoopMode"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "end void",
      "docs": "Schedule a block to be executed on MainThread.\n@param Block - The block to execute on MainThread, example: ^{ UE_LOG(LogMac, Log, TEXT(\"Hello MainThread\"); }\n@param bWait - Wether or not to wait until the block is executed.\n@param WaitMode - The mode we are allowed to execute while waiting. (Only use when bWait = true)\nAvoid being too restrictive on the WaitMode or you could cause a deadlock by preventing further progress."
    },
